            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "compression": 0,
            "text": "{\"markdown\":\"A whitespace-only line indented code keeps is the code's, not a blank line, so it spaces no list or item.\\n\\n\\u003e - ```\\n\\u003e   code\\n\\u003e   \\n\\u003e   note\\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\nAfter.\\n\\n- a\\n\\n  ```\\n      x\\n    \\n  ```\\n- b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n1. a\\n\\n   ```\\n      x\\n      \\n   ```\\n2. b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n\\u003e - a\\n\\u003e\\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\u003e   code\\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\u003e - b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n\\u003e - ```\\n\\u003e     x\\n\\u003e     \\n\\u003e   ```\\n\\u003e   b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n- ```\\n  code\\n  more\\n    \\n  \\n  \\n      \\n  ```\\n- b\\n\\nNext.\\n\\n- a\\n  - b\\n\\n    ```\\n    code\\n    ```\\n  - c\\n\\nEnd.\\n\",\"token\":\"sha256:865494c3baac517ccf31822cd094c0780dc68a137f5172ff2b6ca8e7a13c1464\",\"version\":1}\n"
